# Potentially Suspicious Desktop Background Change Using Reg.EXE | T1112, T1491.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_reg_desktop_background_change.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image="*\\reg.exe" OR OriginalFileName="reg.exe") CommandLine="*add*" (CommandLine IN ("*Control Panel\\Desktop*", "*CurrentVersion\\Policies\\ActiveDesktop*", "*CurrentVersion\\Policies\\System*")) ((CommandLine="*/v NoChangingWallpaper*" CommandLine="*/d 1*") OR (CommandLine="*/v Wallpaper*" CommandLine="*/t REG_SZ*") OR (CommandLine="*/v WallpaperStyle*" CommandLine="*/d 2*"))
